  id: jupiter
  title: Jupiter
  subtitle: THE LARGEST PLANET
  paragraph: A gas giant with more than twice the mass of every other planet combined. The Great Red Spot is a storm wider than Earth that has been turning for at least a century and a half. Ninety-five confirmed moons circle it, among them Europa, which hides an ocean under its ice.
